    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d668">

                <pb facs="0723" n="615" xml:id="pg615"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">711.5112 France/20: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in France</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Herrick</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                    State</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Paraphrase]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Paris</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1927-06-14T11:00:00+01:00"><hi rendition="#italic">June 14,
                                1927—11 a.m.</hi></date><lb/>[Received June 14—7:27
                    a.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>248. As Briand is at Geneva, I conveyed orally to Berthelot<anchor n="4"
                        xml:id="d668-f1"/> substance of your telegram No. 174, June 11, 11 a.m.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Herrick</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d668-f1" n="4" xml:id="d668-f1-content">
                <p>Secretary General of the French Ministry of Foreign Affairs.</p>
